{"body":{"model":"opus","reads":{"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000000"},"seedFrom":"inside","top":{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000001"},"understandings":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000001"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000002"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000003"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000004"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000005"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000006"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000007"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000008"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000009"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000B"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000E"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000T"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000Z"}]},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000000","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000J"],"name":"branch-01"}
{"body":{"matters":"coherence without uniformity","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000002"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000R"}],"prose":"The held space is about how parts that keep their own language, logic and will can still act as a single body. It doesn't do this by giving them one center or one vocabulary. It does it by brokering meaning and priority as each moment needs it. Everything else is how that body is built, how it meets the world, and how it checks itself.","title":"Many selves acting as one"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000001","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what each part is allowed to be","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000003"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000007"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000B"}],"prose":"The whole is built from three things laid over one another: a shape of authority, a way of sharing meaning, and a set of values each made into a role of its own.","title":"How the body is composed"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000002","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"who may overrule whom","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000004"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000005"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000006"}],"prose":"Authority here is both nested and spread out. There is a pyramid with a top that commands, and alongside it a repeated claim that nothing sits at the center. How far each part decides for itself is a setting that can be turned up or down.","title":"The shape of authority"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000003","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"rank by level of nesting","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"Higher wholes hold more authority and lower ones carry out directives within bounds. In practice the connecting holon becomes the summit, with the highest say.","title":"A pyramid inside the holarchy"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000004","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"untouched interiors","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"}],"prose":"Each participant keeps its internal logic. Coordination is offered from above without reaching into any part's interior, and the mediator says it replaces no one.","title":"No center claimed"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000005","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"degree of self-direction","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"Parts can be passive, reactive, adaptive or proactive. A system can also be built with or without the power to rewire its own connections, depending on how much stakeholders are willing to let it decide.","title":"Autonomy as a dial"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000006","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how mismatched meaning gets bridged","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000008"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000009"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000A"}],"prose":"Parts that speak differently are joined by translation and by short-lived agreements, not by one standard everyone adopts. The rest of the body depends on this.","title":"Meaning shared without a common tongue"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000007","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much each party must give up","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"}],"prose":"What separates systems is sorted into kinds and concerns. Three ways of joining are set side by side: everyone adopts one format, everyone maps through a common layer, or each pair translates for itself. The third is chosen because it asks no part to change.","title":"Barriers and three postures"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000008","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how long an agreement lives","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"}],"prose":"Meaning is agreed for one task and discarded when the task ends: a temporary semantic contract in place of a lasting dictionary.","title":"Disposable vocabularies"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000009","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"knowing what exists and how it can link","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006N7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"}],"prose":"The connecting holon is made of a reasoning orchestrator, a translator, and a graph of every known element and how they could link, along with parts that find elements and compose and run workflows across them.","title":"The broker's machinery"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which concern gets its own voice","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000E"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000F"}],"prose":"Concerns usually kept in governance or design reviews are turned into separate actors in the system: one that judges right from wrong, one for fairness, one for the long run, one for understanding context.","title":"Values made into roles"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what a decision is not allowed to do","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"}],"prose":"Ethical and bias-aware parts sit beside decisions, like auditors. They encode norms and known kinds of distortion so these can be weighed together with the task, and they guard against leaks and unfair retrieval.","title":"Checks on what is decided"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000C","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"time span of consequence","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"}],"prose":"Doing a task well is set apart from doing it cheaply. Being well-done is defined as counting effects on the environment, on society, and over time, and nobody yet knows how to measure it.","title":"The long horizon against the short"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000D","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"interpretation that comes before judgment","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"}],"prose":"Interpreting context through structured knowledge comes before fair or effective judgment can happen. The understanding part supplies the knowledge of the situation that the other parts lean on.","title":"Understanding as the ground for others"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000E","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"where one role ends and the next begins","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"}],"prose":"The separate roles keep running into one another. The effective role is shown with the same examples as the ethical one, the mediator is also called the vigilant role, and every role feeds or watches another. This suggests they are aspects of one whole more than separate organs.","title":"Roles that bleed into each other"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000F","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what the outside asks of the whole","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000N"}],"prose":"The body is tested against two kinds of outside: something sudden that arrives and demands a response, and a place so thin that what is missing has to be found.","title":"How the body meets the world"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000G","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"speed of turning sensing into response","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000M"}],"prose":"A disruption sets the body's parts in motion. Some notice it, the connections are rewired while the system keeps running, and competing priorities are settled on the spot.","title":"When the unforeseen arrives"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how widely awareness is shared","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"}],"prose":"Awareness is spread across levels so that parts informed only about their own surroundings do not drift away from the whole. Watchers notice the disaster, the accident, the delay.","title":"Sensing the whole"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"adapting without stopping","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"}],"prose":"Roles, data sources and workflows are reconfigured without a restart. A new participant can join, be understood and be put to work at runtime.","title":"Rewiring while running"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000K","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which value yields to which","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"}],"prose":"Safety and speed, ethics and efficiency, pull against each other. A higher part arbitrates between them, and in a crisis each domain gives way to a different value.","title":"Rival goods settled in the moment"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000M","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"density of service across a territory","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000Q"}],"prose":"The countryside, with few people and few buses, is where the body is cast. In that place, one of its tasks is to make absence visible.","title":"A sparse place as the proving ground"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000N","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what absence looks like","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"}],"prose":"Besides routing journeys, the system maps the places people avoid because nothing reaches them. It turns missing service into something it can report.","title":"Finding what is missing"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000P","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which role takes which post","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"}],"prose":"Each abstract role takes a concrete post. The traveler interprets, the transport service weighs, the infrastructure watches, the communicator translates, and the mediator directs, all from one trip request to the route that comes back.","title":"Roles cast into a journey"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000Q","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"self-examination","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000Y"}],"prose":"The whole checks itself by building copies of itself, by tracing where it came from, and by naming what it has not yet done.","title":"How the body knows itself"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000R","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how closely the double matches the actor","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000T"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000W"}],"prose":"Here simulation is no longer a model built from outside. The parts act in it as themselves, and they can steer the run they are part of.","title":"Simulation by its own doubles"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000S","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"who directs the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"}],"prose":"This kind of simulation descends from agent-based simulation, where simple local rules produce large patterns. Adding levels of nesting lets the simulated entities direct the run as well as live inside it.","title":"From agents to steering holons"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000T","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"keeping copies and real parts in sync","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"Each holon has a copy that plugs into a shared runtime infrastructure. A manager with limited authority synchronizes the copies, and they stay connected to the live parts so they can draw on real data.","title":"Federates as twins"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000V","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"where a discrepancy is caught and reported","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"When a result disagrees with normal operation, the part where it happened flags it, the result is thrown out, and word passes up to the superholon, which may start the run again.","title":"Error travels upward"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000W","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"breadth of domains reached","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"The idea started as a philosophical notion and was taken up on the factory floor. From there it spread to energy grids, construction and cyber-physical systems, carrying the same promise of local autonomy with coordination.","title":"A lineage widening outward"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000X","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much remains unbuilt","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200000Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"Every part comes with its own list of what is still unsolved: standards, scale, privacy, measurement, ontologies still to be built. The whole is presented as a frame for thinking, and its worked case is offered as an illustration, not as proof.","title":"The edges left open"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000Y","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the yardsticks chosen","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"}],"prose":"The rural body is judged by time saved, emissions, access and fairness, and praised for growing and bending. It is judged by these measures, not yet by any field result.","title":"What the case is held to"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200000Z","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}